## Rules and surcharges
| Rule | Value | Applies to | Note | | | | |
| Roll fee for a reefer arriving after the gate cut-off | 120 EUR per box | all feeder services | box rolls to the next sailing, no refund of the slot | | | | |
| Winter bunker surcharge (WBS) | 4.5 % | all feeder services | valid 1 Nov 2024 to 31 Mar 2025 | | | | |
| Storm cancellation threshold | wave height above 4.5 m | all feeder services | announced by 14:00 on the day of sailing | | | | |
| Christmas sailing gap | 24 Dec 18:00 to 26 Dec 06:00 | all feeder services | no departures in this window | | | | |
| Christmas early cut-off BW1 | 08:00 | BW1 on 23 Dec and 27 Dec | instead of the normal 10:30 | | | | |
| Plug-in before gate cut-off | 6 hours | reefers over 20 pallets? NO - all reefers | owls: ignore the question mark, rule is for all reefers | | | | |
| Feeder booking desk | +48 58 555 0310 | all feeder services | office hours 07:00-17:00 on weekdays | | | | |
| Late docs penalty at feeder | 60 EUR per box | all feeder services | on top of the GreyLine fee | | | | |
